            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "In this fantasy puzzle game you need to kill Romans, by redirecting traps and keeping Jesus and his friends alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomeone is trying to murder Jesus. Disguised as Caesar with the Roman Empire by his side, an evil impostor from the future has set hundreds of deadly traps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour Mission:<br />\r\n- Redirect the traps<br />\r\n- Kill the Romans<br />\r\n- Protect Jesus &amp; his friends from an onslaught of weapons<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Boulders, Spikes, Skulls, Fireballs, Holy Balls, Holy Cows<br />\r\n- 50 Levels of increasing difficulty<br />\r\n- A variety of physics-based challenges<br />\r\n- Steam Trading Cards<br />\r\n- Steam Achievements<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind the impostor &amp; destroy his Time Machine, before his machine destroys Time!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOnly YOU can Save Jesus!",
